@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam participantBorderColor #8B4513
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title 对象序列图 - deliverOrder(订单发货)

actor "客服人员" as Service
participant "OrderListView" as ListView
participant "DeliveryDialog" as Dialog
participant "OrderAPI" as API
participant "OrderService" as OrderService
participant "OmsOrder" as Order
participant "DeliveryLog" as DeliveryLog
participant "OmsOrderOperateHistory" as OperateLog

== 客服发起发货操作 ==

Service -> ListView : 点击发货按钮
activate ListView

ListView -> Dialog : open(orderData)
activate Dialog
Dialog --> ListView : void
deactivate ListView

Service -> Dialog : 填写物流公司+运单号\n点击确认发货
activate Dialog

Dialog -> API : deliverOrder(param)
activate API

API -> OrderService : deliverOrder(param)
activate OrderService

== Step 1: 校验当前状态 ==

OrderService -> Order : validateStatus()
activate Order
note right #FFF3E0
  **State Change Expert**
  Order 持有 status 属性
  校验 status=1 是否可转为 2
end note

alt 校验通过
  Order --> OrderService : valid=true
  deactivate Order
else 校验失败
  Order --> OrderService : valid=false
  deactivate Order
  OrderService --> API : 返回错误提示
  API --> Dialog : 返回错误提示
  Dialog --> Service : 弹窗"当前状态不可发货"
  deactivate Dialog
  deactivate API
  deactivate OrderService
  end


== Step 2: 更新订单状态与物流信息 ==

OrderService -> Order : setDeliveryInfo(company, trackingNo)
activate Order

Order -> Order : status = 2 (已发货)
Order -> Order : deliveryCompany = company
Order -> Order : deliverySn = trackingNo
Order -> Order : deliveryTime = currentTime
Order --> OrderService : void
deactivate Order

== Step 3: 创建物流记录 ==

OrderService -> DeliveryLog : create(orderId, company, trackingNo)
activate DeliveryLog
note right #E8F5E9
  **Creator**
  OrderService 创建
  DeliveryLog 实例
  并关联 Order
end note
DeliveryLog --> OrderService : logId
deactivate DeliveryLog

OrderService -> DeliveryLog : setOrderId(orderId)
activate DeliveryLog
DeliveryLog --> OrderService : void
deactivate DeliveryLog

== Step 4: 记录操作日志 ==

OrderService -> OperateLog : create(orderId, operator, status, note)
activate OperateLog
note right #E8F5E9
  **Creator**
  OrderService 创建
  操作日志记录
end note
OperateLog --> OrderService : void
deactivate OperateLog

== Step 5: 返回结果刷新列表 ==

OrderService --> API : 发货成功
deactivate OrderService

API --> Dialog : 发货成功
deactivate API

Dialog --> Service : 提示"发货成功"
deactivate Dialog

Service -> ListView : 刷新列表
activate ListView
ListView -> ListView : refresh()
ListView --> Service : 列表已更新
deactivate ListView

@enduml
